## Development

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and [just](https://just.systems/).

```sh
just setup   # create the environment, install git hooks
just check   # format check, lint, type check, tests
just         # list every recipe
```

| Task | Tool |
| --- | --- |
| Packaging and environments | uv |
| Format and lint | ruff |
| Type check | ty |
| Tests and coverage | pytest, pytest-cov |
| Docs | MkDocs Material, mkdocstrings |
| Git hooks | prek |

The repository carries Claude Code settings (`CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/`): edits
are auto-formatted, `just check` runs before Claude finishes a task, and the
Astral plugin provides the ty language server.
